+        "damped_fixture_contract": "accepted request_v1.json + compact_ir_v1.json; existing node 7 contributes x and the added delta is x+y-4xy, so total relative score is 2x+y-4xy: full endpoint (1,1) loses 1, illegal flower-only (1,0) is rejected, legal circlet-only (0,1) gains 1, then the next linear point has no strict gain",
