+"""Pure, bounded collection for the one-refinement CPU-profile recipe.
+
+No files, subprocesses, experiment allocation, or historical replay validators
+are used here. The caller owns unlinked file reads, command/tool/source pins,
+the test-executable hash, cleanup, and preservation checks. Input text and source
+paths are never copied to the returned evidence.
+"""
