+
+This tool never calls a Theory session or GCSIM.  Its default path prepares the
+existing production request in a disposable directory and reports pins only.
+The explicit ``render=True`` path delegates legality and rendering to the
+production Go ``theoryverify`` packages and retains configs only below a
+caller-owned private job directory after the historical baseline hash passes.
+"""
