+"""Preview-first, exact-pair retirement for the 2026-10-15 native rollbacks.
+
+This is deliberately not a general cleanup command. The CLI has no target or
+root override; each fixed stage recognizes only its two project-relative paths.
+Retirement requires both --execute and --accepted after the rollback manifest,
+installed consumer, engine, pointer and build/install recipe agree.
+The B stage alone permits --abandoned for an exact ae4d consumer retained or
+restored after a failed installation; that flag still defaults to preview.
+"""
